      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": "Base rate/reference class: the six latest official first-print monthly changes available before this forecast are 0.1%, 0.2%, -0.1%, 0.5%, 0.3%, and 0.3%, all from the same seasonally adjusted real GDP by industry variant. Their mean is 0.2167%, so the outside-view base rate is a low-positive monthly gain near 0.2%."
