      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": "Level, momentum, one-off, and policy-mechanism effects: the level path through June was improving after March weakness; momentum is positive but likely fading because StatCan's July advance was essentially unchanged; one-off boosts from census-related public administration and deferred resource maintenance may not persist into September; policy and rate effects should lean mildly restrictive rather than recessionary."
